\(\((ksz - qi)\)\^\(n - 1\)\) Exp[\(-\[Sigma]\^2\) \((qi\^2 - 
                                        qi \((ksz - 
                                        kz)\))\)] + \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFhhdni\ \
\(\((ksz + qi)\)\^\(n - 1\)\) Exp[\(-\[Sigma]\^2\) \((qi\^2 + 
                                        qi \((ksz - 
