\(\((kz + qs)\)\^\(n - 1\)\) Exp[\(-\[Sigma]\^2\) \((qs\^2 - 
                                        qs \((ksz - 
                                        kz)\))\)] + \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFhhdns\ \
\(\((kz - qs)\)\^\(n - 1\)\) Exp[\(-\[Sigma]\^2\) \((qs\^2 + 
                                        qs \((ksz - kz)\))\)])\), {n, 1, TS, 
                      1}]\),
                  FontSlant->"Italic"], 
                StyleBox[";",
                  FontSlant->"Italic"]}], 
              StyleBox["*)",
                FontSlant->"Italic"]}], 
            "\n", \(Ivv = \(\((kz + ksz)\)\^n\) 
                  fvv\ Exp[\(-\[Sigma]\^2\) 
                      kz\ ksz] + \n\t\t\t\t\t\(1\/4\) \((Fvvupi\ \(\((ksz - 
                                qi)\)\^\(n - 1\)\) 
                        Exp[\(-\[Sigma]\^2\) \((qi\^2 - 
                                qi \((ksz - 
                                      kz)\))\)] + \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFvvdni\ \
\(\((ksz + qi)\)\^\(n - 1\)\) 
